{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>WE THANK YOU FOR YOUR SACRIFICE.<br>PLEASE WAIT IN PEACE FOR THE CONDUCTOR TO ARRIVE.<br>EVEN NOW, WE ASK THAT YOU REFRAIN FROM MAKING ANY IMPRINTS OF YOURSELF - THERE IS NO NEED TO ENDANGER YOUR LOVED ONES.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- the train crew on behalf of the <strong>Supreme Engineer</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Card Horror Adventure about Last Human Train</h2><br><strong>Collect cards</strong><br>Search for hidden clues, solve riddles, and talk to the odd strangers you travel with. The train is yours to explore, the trading cards are your reward.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327120/extras/dreadline_collect.gif?t=1749069890\" /><br><i>Knowledge is both a burden and a highest gift.</i><br><br><strong>Combine the cards</strong><br>Sift through your deck, look for connections, find out who is hiding something from you and plan your next steps. Then, turn your intentions into a card combination.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327120/extras/dreadline_combine.gif?t=1749069890\" /><br><i>A puzzle in itself, waiting to be solved, is the train in whose heart we live.</i><br><br><strong>Cast the cards</strong><br>Use what you learned. Manipulate the environment, expose the lies, free yourself. Play your cards right and you might be redeemed.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327120/extras/cast.gif?t=1749069890\" /><br><i>Are we brave enough to face what lies at the end of the tunnel?</i>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3327120?t=1749069890","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327120/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749069890","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327120/fc2b56b